kes parkour obstacles. Experience Emanate's atmospheric environment and fast paced soundtrack as you jump your way to freedom in this single-level, vertical 3D platformer.","steam_appid":1481870,"support_info":{"email":"madebydoomish@gmail.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"English","type":"game","website":null}